{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A long, long time ago, explorers discovered a dungeon in a desolate land. When they entered to explore, they encountered a large number of monsters. In the end, they were no match for the monsters in the tower and fell one by one. However, when they woke up, they found themselves unscathed, lying at the entrance of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After multiple attempts to explore, they found that the situation remained the same. Later, they named the tower after the first explorer who discovered it, calling it the &quot;TOKIGEON&quot; and publicized it to the world. This attracted countless adventurers to come and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to TOKIGEON.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TOKIGEON is a rogue-like dungeon crawler\u00a0game that combines puzzle, deck-building, and auto-battler mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In TOKIGEON, each skill is a puzzle piece. You need to place your skill puzzle pieces on the skill board. When you attack, the skills will cast in the order they are placed on the board. The final damage is calculated by multiplying the weapon damage with the damage from all the skills on the skill board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/MyVideo_2.gif?t=1738929594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Skill\u00a0Combination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you obtain three identical skills, they will combine in a manner similar to other auto-battler games. The combination\u00a0will reward you with a rarer skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/MyVideo_4.gif?t=1738929594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Deck-Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u5356\u8840\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u7834\u788e\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u8fd0\u6c14\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u5492\u529b\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452980?t=1738929594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452980?t=1738929594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/4178a8758ab19844e7a32c578b4d2521ca8a59a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738929594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/4178a8758ab19844e7a32c578b4d2521ca8a59a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738929594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3453050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A long, long time ago, explorers discovered a dungeon in a desolate land. When they entered to explore, they encountered a large number of monsters. In the end, they were no match for the monsters in the tower and fell one by one. However, when they woke up, they found themselves unscathed, lying at the entrance of the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After multiple attempts to explore, they found that the situation remained the same. Later, they named the tower after the first explorer who discovered it, calling it the &quot;TOKIGEON&quot; and publicized it to the world. This attracted countless adventurers to come and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to TOKIGEON.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TOKIGEON is a rogue-like dungeon crawler\u00a0game that combines puzzle, deck-building, and auto-battler mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In TOKIGEON, each skill is a puzzle piece. You need to place your skill puzzle pieces on the skill board. When you attack, the skills will cast in the order they are placed on the board. The final damage is calculated by multiplying the weapon damage with the damage from all the skills on the skill board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/MyVideo_2.gif?t=1738929594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Skill\u00a0Combination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you obtain three identical skills, they will combine in a manner similar to other auto-battler games. The combination\u00a0will reward you with a rarer skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/MyVideo_4.gif?t=1738929594\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Deck-Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u5356\u8840\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u7834\u788e\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452980/extras/\u8fd0\u6c14\u6d41.gif?t=1738929594\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s